and condition:(bool|command)... -> boolean
True if all arguments are true

Every argument to and must be either a boolean or a command that returns a 
boolean. The and command will check all arguments in order, and if any of them 
are false, and will return false. If all conditions are true, and returns true.

Do note that [32mand[0m is a short circuiting command, meaning that if one of the 
conditions is found to be false, [32mand[0m will not evaluate any remaining closures.

In expression mode, this method can be used via the the [32mand[0m operator.

[4mExamples[0m
[33m# true, if $file exists and is a symlink[0m
[32mand[0m [36m$([0m[36m$file[0m[36m:[0m[36mexists[0m[36m)[0m [36m{[0m[36m$([0m[36mstat[0m [36m$file[0m[36m)[0m[36m[[0m[36m0[0m[36m][0m[36m:[0m[36mis_symlink[0m[36m}[0m

[33m# true, if $file exists and is a symlink[0m
[36m([0m[36m$file[0m[36m.[0m[36mexists[0m[36m([0m[36m)[0m [36mand[0m [36m{[0m[32mstat[0m[36m([0m[36m$file[0m[36m)[0m[36m[[0m[36m0[0m[36m][0m[36m.[0m[36mis_symlink[0m[36m}[0m[36m)[0m

or condition:(bool|command)... -> boolean
True if any argument is true

Every argument to or must be either a [32mboolean[0m or a command that returns a [32mboolean[0m. The or 
command will check all arguments in order, and if any of them are [32mtrue[0m, or will 
return [32mtrue[0m. If all conditions are [32mfalse[0m, or returns [32mfalse[0m.

Do note that [32mor[0m is a short circuiting command, meaning that if one of the 
conditions is found to be true, [32mor[0m will not evaluate any remaining closures.

In expression mode, this method can be used via the the [32mor[0m operator.

[4mExamples[0m
[36m$stat_out[0m [36m:=[0m [36m$([0m[36mstat[0m [36m$file[0m[36m)[0m[36m[[0m[36m0[0m[36m][0m

[33m# true, if $file is either a symlink or a directory[0m
[32mor[0m [36m$stat_out[0m[36m:[0m[36mis_symlink[0m [36m$stat_out[0m[36m:[0m[36mis_dir[0m

[33m# true, if $file is either a symlink or a directory[0m
[36m([0m[36m$stat_out[0m[36m.[0m[36mis_symlink[0m [36mor[0m [36m$stat_out[0m[36m.[0m[36mis_dir[0m[36m)[0m

