Parse json format

When deserializing a list, [32mjson:from[0m will try to infer the type of the list. If all of 
the elements of the list are of the same type, the list will be parametrized to 
the same type. If all elements are objects, and all objects have the same set of 
fields with the same types, the list will be turned into a table.

This command accepts the following arguments:

 * [32mfiles[0m source to read from. If unspecified, will read from input, which must be a [32m
         string[0m, [32mbinary[0m or [32mbinary_stream[0m.

