When serializing a list, some types have to be squashed, because json does not 
have all the same types that Crush does:

 * [32mtime[0m     values are turned into strings in the RFC 3339 format.
 * [32mduration[0m values are turned into the integer number of seconds in the duration.

This command accepts the following arguments:

